# Component structure

When editing or adding renderer UI, follow [docs/component-structure.md](../../docs/component-structure.md).

## Quick rules

- Prefer feature-local `components/` + `<area>Model.ts`; do not create global `atoms/` trees.
- Split pages/sections at ~250–300 lines, 3+ visual blocks, or duplicated JSX.
- Pages compose; organisms/molecules render; model files hold pure helpers.
- Keep `data-*` selectors stable for visual/e2e scripts. If you change visible
  copy, roles, or those selectors, update `scripts/e2e-*.cjs` in the same PR
  ([docs/e2e-validation.md](../../docs/e2e-validation.md#ui-changes-and-e2e)).
- Reference layout: `src/renderer/src/features/clusters/`.
